abstract: >-
  Mathematical accounts, Lean 4 proofs and reproducible verification tools for
  covering designs. Includes C(13,7,4)=30, C(20,11,3)=12, lower bounds and
  exact values for C(2k-c,k,3), and C(18,10,3)=12 with five lifted lower bounds,
  together with 41 <= C(14,5,3) <= 43 and the eight known exact values
  C(12u+1,4,3)=(12u+1)(12u)^2/24 for 1 <= u <= 8. Includes explicit block
  lists, their checked correspondence to Lean families, C(34,18,3)=13 using
  the historical LJCR witness, and ten explicit Schoenheim corollaries of
  the published lower seeds at (14,5,3) and (34,18,3), together with supporting
  formalisations of established results.
  OpenAI language models substantially assisted its
  development, formalisation, checking and writing. The proof accounts and
  third-party notices document mathematical attribution and historical
  constructions.
keywords:
  - covering designs
  - covering numbers
  - combinatorics
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
